-los-milagros-liga-1-noticia/\" rel=\"\"><b>Sacerdote en Las Nazarenas enciende polémica: “Nadie puede apropiarse de esta devoción”</b></a>"},{"_id":"5WM4NC7HVVEOHPAN5ON7QP4EJY","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://trome.com/deportes/futbol-peruano/jose-tunche-rivera-se-falla-un-increible-gol-en-la-goleada-de-universitario-4-1-sobre-alianza-atletico-de-sullana-video-noticia/\" rel=\"\"><b>El Tunche Rivera se falla un increíble gol en la goleada de Universitario 4-1 sobre Alianza Atlético de Sullana | VIDEO</b></a>"}]},{"_id":"GG3M6ZYW5VBCRDC3ULDIWN3GSU","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"¡Sin lugar para la duda! <mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>Universitario y Juan Pablo II College </b></mark>disputarán HOY uno de los duelos más interesantes de <b>la fecha 13 del Clausura</b>, con la meta de seguir luchando por el título de este torneo. Los cremas son favoritos, pero ya otros equipos del interior han sabido aguarle la fiesta. ¡Sigue el ‘minuto a minuto’!"},{"_id":"NNYQDCXXRBGOPDEJNVNQULFXNU","title":"TE VA A INTERESAR:","type":"link_list","items":[{"image":{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"1f22405dca94481bc98b706b22da2b323ce12c31202253e186e33bb8ac319e12"},"vanity_credits":{"by":[{"name":"","type":"author"}]},"caption":"","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/LGTKOJ36KRA4NNA6FR5BJNECA4.jpg","licensable":false,"alt_text":"‘Lateando con Puchungo’ deja las calles de Lima y llega hasta Huacho para conocer el barrio de Juan ‘Peluquita’ Saavedra. ‘Sampi’ reveló su temor a vecina, sus viajes de ocho horas diarias a Lima, su etapa de vendedor de cremolada y como cobrador de combi.","credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"","width":1200,"_id":"LGTKOJ36KRA4NNA6FR5BJNECA4","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/LGTKOJ36KRA4NNA6FR5BJNECA4.jpg?auth=1f22405dca94481bc98b706b22da2b323ce12c31202253e186e33bb8ac319e12","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/LGTKOJ36KRA4NNA6FR5BJNECA4.jpg?auth=1f22405dca94481bc98b706b22da2b323ce12c31202253e186e33bb8ac319e12","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/LGTKOJ36KRA4NNA6FR5BJNECA4.jpg","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/LGTKOJ36KRA4NNA6FR5BJNECA4.jpg?auth=1f22405dca94481bc98b706b22da2b323ce12c31202253e186e33bb8ac319e12","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/LGTKOJ36KRA4NNA6FR5BJNECA4.jpg?auth=1f22405dca94481bc98b706b22da2b323ce12c31202253e186e33bb8ac319e12&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"LATEANDO.jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-22T01:37:05Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-22T01:37:05Z","height":800,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},"description":{"_id":"KTPVUY2MSFH5LCHC2BHNBLR4YQ","type":"text","content":""},"_id":"FC33WNPT5NG4TB7JZ73GN5ORKI","additional_properties":{"nofollow":false,"sponsored":false,"openInNewTab":false},"type":"interstitial_link","content":"‘Peluquita’ Saavedra: la guapeada de Cueto, la broncaza por Balán y más","url":"https://trome.com/deportes/futbol-peruano/peluquita-saavedra-su-reclamo-a-pinto-la-guapeada-de-cesar-cueto-la-broncaza-por-balan-y-mas-video-fotos-lateando-con-puchungo-historias-de-futbolistas-noticia/"},{"image":{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"effa24b293e048e4f500e0944d1b3a750fcd2ea95161f76de6e5b0f8f4b2e292"},"vanity_credits":{"by":[{"name":"","type":"author"}]},"caption":"","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","