FL223WE","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"50′ Universitario a disparado 10 veces al arco en el reincio del partido y no logra abir el marcador! "},{"_id":"DGZQ7BRBOBCHNARN24OSUB6CIQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"45′ Arranca el complemento!"},{"_id":"YOPAIW7P5ZEKBIAOVZPFDEWAAA","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<b>PRIMER TIEMPO</b>:"},{"_id":"3IBTDELPQVG7XEGRYRJ5JPSMKA","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"45′ Final del primer tiempo y los cremas no pudieron reflejar el dominio en el marcador! "},{"_id":"KUK3SOMIXFFZTO4MM2T7RXQHG4","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"41′ Valera ganó la linea, sacó el centro y nadie la pudo conectar!"},{"_id":"ZA7RQDA25JGGNKBNXZFVHH62OQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"30′ DE CABEZA! Lapadula cada vez más cerca!!!! "},{"_id":"ZPWGK7OZXZD5ZPMVQVEYECHJQU","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"29′ Universitario asedia el arco norteño, pero no es eficaz !! "},{"_id":"R3Q2MLABQZDVBF3CWM55UHOUOQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"25′ LApadula remata sin fuerza y contiene al golero Vega!!! "},{"_id":"EBZ2G56IJND7FEZIXTS5H3QVUQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"15′ Riveros conecta cabezazo y pasa cerca del traveaño "},{"_id":"LUDN2NAZONF7PHEWCCAU5BEXWI","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"10′ Lapadula cae al césped y se queja de contacto por detrás! "},{"_id":"EP2RYW4PJBASRN6URPAZJMPUIA","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"8′ VALERA sorprende con un remate que psa cerca del Arco de Juan Pablo."},{"_id":"AO7F4SMPBZFZ7MXYEYWDC3O6PI","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"5′ GIANLUCA Paladula buscó la chalaca y se le fue lejos! "},{"_id":"LT7XPHFUVRFJ5C4A2IUZIUH7EU","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"3′ Primer corner para los cremas. Riveros no llega al cabezazo! "},{"_id":"64PCMGT3DFDYFDUG64RYC3HJVA","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"1′ Arrancó el partido!!!"},{"_id":"DKKYVYBCHFDXBN6X26FCXOF5ZM","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"- Saltan los equipos al campo de juego!!!! "},{"_id":"VKMXY3SKAFDFBPMYEFZ5FBGKQY","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"- Administración rinde homenaje a Juan José Oré! "},{"_id":"JFWR7T2E2VD35HGDJMKICL4EKA","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"- Calientan los equipos en el colso de Ate "},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"fabc76b97d59f6be89b2f7c8eadfcb0b9afaef7a3d47edbfdda878c851e45e5c"},"caption":"Once confirmado de Fabián Bustos ante Juan Pablo (Imagen: @Universitario)","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/II3MLLIFYBFNBIJEB2YBHZY5TU.jpg","licensable":false,"alt_text":"El equipo de Fabián Bustos salta al campo obligado a conseguir los tres puntos ante Juan Pablo II para mantenerse como escolta del líder en su lucha por el Torneo Clausura.","credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"Once confirmado de Fabián Bustos ante Juan Pablo (Imagen: @Universitario)","width":544,"_id":"II3MLLIFYBFNBIJEB2YBHZY5TU","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/II3MLLIFYBFNBIJEB2YBHZY5TU.jpg?auth=fabc76b97d59f6be89b2f7c8eadfcb0b9afaef7a3d47edbfdda878c851e45e5c","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/II3MLLIFYBFNBIJEB2YBHZY5TU.jpg?auth=fabc76b97d59f6be89b2f7c8eadfcb0b9afaef7a3d47edbfdda878c851e45e5c","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/II3MLLIFYBFNBIJEB2YBHZY5TU.jpg","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/II3MLLIFYBFNBIJEB2YBHZY5TU.jpg?auth=fabc76b97d59f6be89b2f7c8eadfcb0b9afaef7a3d47edbfdda878c851e45e5c","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/II3MLLIFYBFNBIJEB2YBHZY5TU.jpg?auth=fabc76b97d59f6be89b2f7c8eadfcb0b9afaef7a3d47edbfdda878c851e45e5c&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"once.jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-25T01:25:20Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-25T01:25:20Z","height":680,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"level":2,"_id":"YF7FEMFGLBEOFBPP33KCDBYWYM","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>Universitario vs. Juan Pablo II College - La Previa </b></mark>"},{"_id":"AFQYUYCJXVH35KTIGOBPVNSN7U","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>La escuadra merengue</b></mark> ha tenido un envión anímico que quedó demostrado en el triunfo 4-1 ante Alianza Atlético de Sullana en Trujillo. La llegada del argentino Fabián Bustos ha servido para la recuperación de algunos baluartes del Tricampeonato como Edison Flores y Horacio Calcaterra."},{"_id":"L6VG7ODGDJEI3PI6OJOSXYH26M","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>El cuadro de Chongoyape</b></mark> ha hecho un destacado Torneo Clausura, logrando cinco victorias en sus últimos siete encuentros. Resultados que le han permitido sumar 22 puntos y ubicarse a tres puntos de los líderes Sporting Cristal y Sport Huancayo."},{"level":2,"_id":"MRJ5OCMNBJGULMM57S6KIZFKLQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>Universitario vs. Juan Pablo II College: ¿Cómo llegan a este encuentro?</b></mark>"},{"_id":"EXBRBKHYNNH55PTVYS7QBUIVXU","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>Universitario</b></mark> llega a este duelo con un fuerte envión anímico, tras la llegada del argentino Bustos. Luego de ir perdiendo 0-2 ante Melgar, logró empatar y casi se lleva el triunfo, mientras que en el siguiente encuentro aplastó 4-1 a Alianza Atlético de Sullana. "},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"6fed47a667fd6d40cd123acb2dbe68dd7d98ab128d51ce5c68df9d1ef98d1fed"},"caption":"Lizandro Alzugaray estará a la expectativa ante Juan Pablo II College | Foto: Giancarlo Ávila/ @photo.gec","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/ENKWKH63G5ARXM5ET5FSGKINRY.jpg","licensable":false,"credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"Lizando Alzugaray","width":1200,"_id":"ENKWKH63G5ARXM5ET5FSGKINRY","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/ENKWKH63G5ARXM5ET5FSGKINRY.jpg?auth=6fed47a667fd6d40cd123acb2dbe68dd7d98ab128d51ce5c68df9d1ef98d1fed","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/ENKWKH63G5ARXM5ET5FSGKINRY.jpg?auth=6fed47a667fd6d40cd123acb2dbe68dd7d98ab128d51ce5c68df9d1ef98d1fed","link":"","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/ENKWKH63G5ARXM5ET5FSGKINRY.jpg","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/ENKWKH63G5ARXM5ET5FSGKINRY.jpg?auth=6fed47a667fd6d40cd123acb2dbe68dd7d98ab128d51ce5c68df9d1ef98d1fed","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/ENKWKH63G5ARXM5ET5FSGKINRY.jpg?auth=6fed47a667fd6d40cd123acb2dbe68dd7d98ab128d51ce5c68df9d1ef98d1fed&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"01.jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","alt_text":"","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-09-13T03:21:53Z","last_updated_date":"2026-09-13T03:21:53Z","height":792,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"_id":"M4FZLTK7WZBTPAO6ACWI4KNTCY","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"En tanto,<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b> Juan Pablo II College</b></mark> llega a este duelo luego de una victoria 2-0 ante Sport Boys, con goles de Erinson Ramírez y el volante cedido por <u><b>Universitario Álvaro Rojas. </b></u>"},{"level":2,"_id":"AMEWFDTCM5FVZG6UV3R5TUMLIQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><u><b>¿Cuándo y dónde juegan Universitario vs. Juan Pablo II College en la fecha 13 del Torneo Clausura 2026?</b></u></mark>"},{"_id":"GIJ76FWJIFC5TKGKHWTY7LK2BQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"El duelo entre <mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>Universitario y Juan Pablo II College</b></mark><mark class=\"hl_yellow\"> </mark>se llevará a cabo este sábado 24 de octubre en el estadio Monumental ‘U’ Marathon, con capacidad para recibir a más de 80 mil personas."},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"7a41822789ce64191f8bdb9f6ba2411000315f73725b7909ca6b263204d07775"},"caption":"Universitario confía en la capacidad goleadora de Gianluca Lapadula. (Foto: Fernando Sangama / GEC)","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/IYT6DE3C4FA5ROEXF4OKTMNK7E.jpg","licensable":false,"credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"Universitario vs. Comerciantes Unidos. (Foto: Fernando Sangama / GEC)","width":3750,"_id":"IYT6DE3C4FA5ROEXF4OKTMNK7E","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/IYT6DE3C4FA5ROEXF4OKTMNK7E.jpg?auth=7a41822789ce64191f8bdb9f6ba2411000315f73725b7909ca6b263204d07775","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/IYT6DE3C4FA5ROEXF4OKTMNK7E.jpg?auth=7a41822789ce64191f8bdb9f6ba2411000315f73725b7909ca6b263204d07775","link":"","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/IYT6DE3C4FA5ROEXF4OKTMNK7E.jpg","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/IYT6DE3C4FA5ROEXF4OKTMNK7E.jpg?auth=7a41822789ce64191f8bdb9f6ba2411000315f73725b7909ca6b263204d07775","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/IYT6DE3C4FA5ROEXF4OKTMNK7E.jpg?auth=7a41822789c