":"<a href=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/magaly-medina-hace-personal-confesion-sobre-el-padre-de-su-hijo-y-ella-tu-crees-que-yo-me-peleaba-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" title=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/magaly-medina-hace-personal-confesion-sobre-el-padre-de-su-hijo-y-ella-tu-crees-que-yo-me-peleaba-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\">Magaly Medina hace personal confesión sobre el padre de su hijo y ella: “¿Tú crees que yo...?\"</a>"}]},{"_id":"BL2C6BFQXRD23C2FU2HQHWO5GQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/andrea-san-martin-sale-a-la-luz-la-videollamada-de-la-modelo-con-su-hija-y-juan-victor-sanchez-antes-de-su-detencion-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" title=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/andrea-san-martin-sale-a-la-luz-la-videollamada-de-la-modelo-con-su-hija-y-juan-victor-sanchez-antes-de-su-detencion-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\">Juan Víctor</a> reapareció en <b>Instagram</b> tras varias horas sin publicar contenido y compartió una fotografía junto a su hija, quien permanece al cuidado de la familia paterna. La publicación llamó la atención porque se produjo después de que <b>Andrea San Martín</b> recuperara su libertad, tras permanecer cerca de 40 horas detenida por la denuncia de presunto maltrato contra la menor. "},{"_id":"6QZPASBNBZG5BHO3Q5E3B3RZAE","title":"MIRA TAMBIÉN:","type":"link_list","items":[{"image":{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"9f949f27954913326862f2bdb3ebebdf8584efcfa3883eed6fd00be2100e1773"},"vanity_credits":{"by":[{"name":"","type":"author"}]},"caption":"","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/NZ426W7OLBBDVHDUFQWJHPKIGM.png","licensable":false,"alt_text":"Andrea San Martín saldrá a dar conferencia de prensa tal como lo dijo ante las cámras al ser detenida, confirma Leysi Suárez.","credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"","width":1019,"_id":"NZ426W7OLBBDVHDUFQWJHPKIGM","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/NZ426W7OLBBDVHDUFQWJHPKIGM.png?auth=9f949f27954913326862f2bdb3ebebdf8584efcfa3883eed6fd00be2100e1773","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/NZ426W7OLBBDVHDUFQWJHPKIGM.png?auth=9f949f27954913326862f2bdb3ebebdf8584efcfa3883eed6fd00be2100e1773","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/NZ426W7OLBBDVHDUFQWJHPKIGM.png","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/NZ426W7OLBBDVHDUFQWJHPKIGM.png?auth=9f949f27954913326862f2bdb3ebebdf8584efcfa3883eed6fd00be2100e1773","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/NZ426W7OLBBDVHDUFQWJHPKIGM.png?auth=9f949f27954913326862f2bdb3ebebdf8584efcfa3883eed6fd00be2100e1773&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"andrea san martin.png","mime_type":"image/png","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-24T03:43:02Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-24T03:43:02Z","height":676,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},"description":{"_id":"SW6EPU7WGZHG3BS5WE422MZXGI","type":"text","content":""},"_id":"PJZVTI7YBRAYXJOGYGX4QXNRTU","additional_properties":{"nofollow":false,"sponsored":false,"openInNewTab":false},"type":"interstitial_link","content":"Lanzan importante información sobre Andrea San Martín tras liberación luego de grave denuncia: “En las próximas horas...”","url":"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/andrea-san-martin-lanzan-importante-informacion-sobre-la-exchica-reality-tras-liberacion-luego-de-grave-denuncia-en-las-proximas-horas-foto-video-farandula-noticia/"},{"image":{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"6356ea6cb9c3b4232d60ebca62b6101740190ddbb790798ab15d48907efed6cc"},"vanity_credits":{"by":[{"name":"","type":"author"}]},"caption":"","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/MXA7UDVTTZH4VEJJYPDMRG4R6M.png","licensable":false,"credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"","width":1200,"_id":"MXA7UDVTTZH4VEJJYPDMRG4R6M","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/MXA7UDVTTZH4VEJJYPDMRG4R6M.png?auth=6356ea6cb9c3b4232d60ebca62b6101740190ddbb790798ab15d48907efed6cc","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/MXA7UDVTTZH4VEJJYPDMRG4R6M.png?auth=6356ea6cb9c3b4232d60ebca62b6101740190ddbb790798ab15d48907efed6cc","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/MXA7UDVTTZH4VEJJYPDMRG4R6M.png","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/MXA7UDVTTZH4VEJJYPDMRG4R6M.png?auth=6356ea6cb9c3b4232d60ebca62b6101740190ddbb790798ab15d48907efed6cc","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/MXA7UDVTTZH4VEJJYPDMRG4R6M.png?auth=6356ea6cb9c3b4232d60ebca62b6101740190ddbb790798ab15d48907efed6cc&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"yanorenieguesñoñita.png","mime_type":"image/png","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-23T19:51:37Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-23T19:51:37Z","height":700,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},"description":{"_id":"EBUJKCXCUBCVHPWQNNLR5FTMAU","type":"text","content":""},"_id":"4UJORTYXZJA73I4RFSLWSCA77U","additional_properties":{"nofollow":false,"sponsored":false,"openInNewTab":false},"type":"interstitial_link","content":"Andrea San Martín llama la atención con su actitud tras quedar libre por grave denuncia: ¿cómo reaccionó?","url":"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/andrea-san-martin-y-su-insolita-reaccion-tras-quedar-en-libertad-por-denuncia-de-presunto-maltrato-a-su-hija-foto-video-farandula-noticia/"}]},{"_id":"OTO36OMCAREDPNRQW3VBCBUBZQ","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>Juan Víctor</b></mark>, quien el pasado 20 de octubre denunció a la ‘ojiverde’ en la comisaría de La Molina por presunto maltrato a su hija, ahora está compartiendo tiempo con la criatura. En las últimas horas, la menor sorprendió a su progenitor, pues se le cayó uno de los dientes."},{"_id":"F5D5WARTJBAJVO7PM4TSYHI5XE","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Él mismo compartió lo que sucedió este viernes 23 de octubre, mientras<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b> Andrea San Martín,</b></mark> al parecer, continúa alejada de la pequeña. En la fotografía aparece la niña con una gran sonrisa, mientras su papá muestra el diente que se le cayó."},{"_id":"7KONSX4GURHNJK5XPKSDM3IGQA","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Usuarios de Instagram reaccionaron de inmediato a la reciente historia de Juan Víctor y resaltaron el buen papá que es. Muchos se mostraron a favor de él y conformes con la denuncia que puso contra la exchica reality"},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"1fc4bc04ea1b1ea0199cfc30dd6d4ca8a39efe8c13fda2c23e26d1717a33237c"},"caption":"Juan Víctor revela lo que pasó con su hija, lejos de Andrea San Martín.","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/U3QDNWAW4NHLHGFG6QGFPHAWCU.png","licensable":false,"alt_text":"Juan Víctor revela lo que pasó con su hija, lejos de Andrea San Martín.","credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"Juan Víctor","width":503,"_id":"U3QDNWAW4NHLHGFG6QGFPHAWCU","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/U3QDNWAW4NHLHGFG6QGFPHAWCU.png?auth=1fc4bc04ea1b1ea0199cfc30dd6d4ca8a39efe8c13fda2c23e26d1717a33237c","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/U3QDNWAW4NHLHGFG6QGFPHAWCU.png?auth=1fc4bc04ea1b1ea0199cfc30dd6d4ca8a39efe8c13fda2c23e26d1717a33237c","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/U3QDNWAW4NHLHGFG6QGFPHAWCU.png","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/U3QDNWAW4NHLHGFG6QGFPHAWCU.png?auth=1fc4bc04ea1b1ea0199cfc30dd6d4ca8a39efe8c13fda2c23e26d1717a33237c","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/U3QDNWAW4NHLHGFG6QGFPHAWCU.png?auth=1fc4bc04ea1b1ea0199cfc30dd6d4ca8a39efe8c13fda2c23e26d1717a33237c&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"JUAN VICTOR.png","mime_type":"image/png","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-24T04:33:45Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-24T04:33:45Z","height":767,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"_id":"IJJABDOU6ZHPDHUJGR5XQZL45Q","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<i>“Siempre se supo que eras un gran papá”, “Ojalá se quede siempre contigo”, “Fuerzas, Juan Víctor. Se le ve muy bien a tu lado”, “Se merece ser feliz con las personas que le recuerdan lo valiosa que es” o “Eres el mejor papá que puede tener”</i>, fueron algunos comentarios."},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"110ed5a80569c2f8a3e1c413b764943f1a05a6ee5927eab744d99907df881b56"},"caption":"Usuarios a favor de Juan Víctor tras liberación de Andrea San Martín.","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/6TA2RB7YZBANHD44LX7WGEP4BU.jpg","licensable":false,"alt_text":"Usuarios a favor de Juan Víctor tras liberación de Andrea San Martín.","credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"Juan Víctor","width":610,"_id":"6TA2RB7YZBANHD44LX7WGEP4BU","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/6TA2RB7YZBANHD44LX7WGEP4BU.jpg?auth=110ed5a80569c2f8a3e1c413b764943f1a05a6ee5927eab744d99907df881b56","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/6TA2RB7YZBANHD44LX7WGEP4BU.jpg?auth=110ed5a80569c2f8a3e1c413b764943f1a05a6ee5927eab744d99907df881b56","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/6TA2RB7YZBANHD44LX7WGEP4BU.jpg","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/6TA2RB7YZBANHD44LX7WGEP4BU.jpg?auth=110ed5a80569c2f8a3e1c413b764943f1a05a6ee5927eab744d99907df881b56","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/6TA2RB7YZBANHD44LX7WGEP4BU.jpg?auth=110ed5a80569c2f8a3e1c413b764943f1a05a6ee5927eab744d99907df881b56&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"JUAN VICTOR1.jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-24T04:33:45Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-24T04:33:45Z","height":1280,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"level":2,"_id":"JS7ENGRNMZGGPHTY3FQINAMTUM","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>¿Qué pasará con Andrea tras recuperar libertad?</b></mark>"},{"_id":"22IECA3R5VHRREF44T2FFUMHHU","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Este viernes 23 de octubre, <mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>Andrea San Martín quedó en libertad tras la denuncia de Juan Víctor </b></mark>por presunto maltrato a su hija y abandonó la comisaría en un auto blanco. Ella lo hizo con total serenidad."},{"_id":"6VK76XPTSRF6XBIZC6RFHD3QXY","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Sin embargo, su amiga <b>Leysi Suárez</b> reveló lo que pasará con la exchica reality ahora que está fuera de la dependencia. Ella confirmó que la ‘ojiverde’ sí dará una conferencia, tal como lo anunció a la prensa cuando fue intervenida."},{"_id":"65WFYFPT6NGR5BQ4H5UX7KCU5E","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><i><u>“Y me dijo: ‘Andrea va a hablar en las próximas horas’ y va a dar una versión que no ha podido dar y muchos lo van a entender”</u></i></mark><i>, </i>contó Samuel Suárez al revelar lo que habló con Leysi."},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"bf50cc7c76ae5335321cb25c072cd16f2d4c6a2aedad423ea112b32650c92d4d"},"caption":"La modelo estuvo detenida por casi 48 horas en la comisaría de Miraflores tras una presunta agresión a su hija menor de edad | Foto: Captura de Amor y Fuego (YouTube)","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/CFTYSZGPVJBVVOY6WJA36G7TKA.png","licensable":false,"credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"Andrea San Martín","width":1200,"_id":"CFTYSZGPVJBVVOY6WJA36G7TKA","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/CFTYSZGPVJBVVOY6WJA36G7TKA.png?auth=bf50cc7c76ae5335321cb25c072cd16f2d4c6a2aedad423ea112b32650c92d4d","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/CFTYSZGPVJBVVOY6WJA36G7TKA.png?auth=bf50cc7c76ae5335321cb25c072cd16f2d4c6a2aedad423ea112b32650c92d4d","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/CFTYSZGPVJBVVOY6WJA36G7TKA.png","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/CFTYSZGPVJBVVOY6WJA36G7TKA.png?auth=bf50cc7c76ae5335321cb25c072cd16f2d4c6a2aedad423ea112b32650c92d4d","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/CFTYSZGPVJBVVOY6WJA36G7TKA.png?auth=bf50cc7c76ae5335321cb25c072cd16f2d4c6a2aedad423ea112b32650c92d4d&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"san martin.png","mime_type":"image/png","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-23T23:17:51Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-23T23:17:51Z","height":800,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"_id":"UEKUQGYBOBGCZD2MRVG4523LQA","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<b>TE PUEDE INTERESAR</b>"},{"list_type":"unordered","_id":"ZW5B4OTWPVACNLO7SC62UMZS44","type":"list","items":[{"_id":"RMDJCK7UC5DJFCLV4HTWPN5CVQ","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/suheyn-cipriani-llora-desconsoladamente-al-anunciar-su-renuncia-a-podcast-por-el-miss-peru-2027-es-mi-sueno-mas-grande-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" title=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/suheyn-cipriani-llora-desconsoladamente-al-anunciar-su-renuncia-a-podcast-por-el-miss-peru-2027-es-mi-sueno-mas-grande-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\">Suheyn Cipriani llora desconsoladamente al anunciar importante decisión: “Es mi sueño más grande”</a>"},{"_id":"FB2SD5BU5ZC3FKP424H67P7JKA","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/andrea-san-martin-leysi-suarez-lapida-a-tilsa-lozano-por-llorar-y-arremeter-tras-denuncia-van-a-tener-que-recoger-sus-lagrimas-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" title=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/andrea-san-martin-leysi-suarez-lapida-a-tilsa-lozano-por-llorar-y-arremeter-tras-denuncia-van-a-tener-que-recoger-sus-lagrimas-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\">Leysi Suárez ¿lapida a Tilsa? por llorar y arremeter contra Andrea: “Van a tener que recoger sus lágrimas”</a>"},{"_id":"PZTYADNGYFGNBCE5E5NLMZ444I","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/melcochita-pablo-villanueva-tiene-fuerte-pelea-en-vivo-con-sus-hijas-mayores-tras-compra-de-departamento-a-nombre-de-heydi-amado-es-problema-mio-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" title=\"https://trome.com/espectaculos/tv/melcochita-pablo-villanueva-tiene-fuerte-pelea-en-vivo-con-sus-hijas-mayores-tras-compra-de-departamento-a-nombre-de-heydi-amado-es-problema-mio-foto-video-farandula-noticia/\">¡Melcochita estalla! Se enfrenta EN VIVO a sus hijas por ‘depa’ a nombre de Heydi: “Es problema mío”</a>"}]},{"subtype":"about_author","_id":"YTYM2RIBJBFTTDKMWNV5USMQUY","embed":{"id":"1792816027349","config":{"authorTwitter":"tromepe","authorSlug":"redaccion-farandula","authorName":"Redacción Farándula","authorImage":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/arc-authors/elcomercio/60f1ba02-0012-4ed9-81e1-31cc5411d04c.jpg","authorLinkedIn":"","authorBio":"Somos el mejor equipo tras la farándula peruana. De 'Chollywood', con amor. Historias confirmadas, contrastadas y verificadas. Porque tu entretenimiento es una cosa muy seria para nosotros."},"url":"/pf/api/v3/content/fetch/photo-by-id"},"type":"custom_embed"},{"_id":"6RZDLDKKERH4VHIE4E2GZHZW74","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":""}],"subheadlines":{"basic":"El padre de la menor reapareció en redes sociales con una publicación que generó numerosos comentarios en medio de la denuncia contra la influencer."},"description":{"basic":"Juan Víctor sorprendió al reaparecer en redes con inesperada publicación, mientras Andrea San Martín continúa en silencio tras quedar libre."},"source":{"system":"composer","name":"elcomercio","source_type":"staff"},"taxonomy":{"sections":[{"path":"/espectaculos/tv","parent":{"default":"/espectaculos"},"_website":"tromecom","parent_id":"/espectaculos","name":"Tv","description":null,"_id":"/espectaculos/tv","additional_properties":{"original":{"parent":{"header-pro":"/espectaculos","default":"/espectaculos","menu-default":"/espectaculos","footer-default":null,"menu-pro":"/espectaculos"},"social":{"twitter":null,"rss":null,"facebook":null,"instagram":null},"site_topper":{"site_logo_image":null},"site":{"pagebuilder_path_for_native_apps":null,"site_url":null,"site_keywords":null,"site_about":null,"site_description":null,"site_title":null,"site_tagline":null},"navigation":{"nav_title":null},"_admin":{"alias_ids":["/espectaculos/tv"]},"inactive":false,"node_type":"section","_website":"tromecom","name":"Tv","_id":"/espectaculos/tv","ancestors":{"header-pro":["/