WLCG5G2ZB55MOUD77D2WQ.png","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/DMT7BWLCG5G2ZB55MOUD77D2WQ.png?auth=712340fc956db2b0c18b5a787b9a96e4ac4179d6c53ee96578b86fae96edaf26","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/DMT7BWLCG5G2ZB55MOUD77D2WQ.png?auth=712340fc956db2b0c18b5a787b9a96e4ac4179d6c53ee96578b86fae96edaf26&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"LEONARD LEÓN y su esposa OLENKA también promocionaron los helados de MELANIE MARTÍNEZ (4).png","mime_type":"image/png","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-24T13:49:30Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-24T13:49:30Z","height":800,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},"description":{"_id":"WVFMW7XF6RBHTMQO36AVRVOF4A","type":"text","content":""},"_id":"JHJS73QARJAE3AE3G4FPER5B64","additional_properties":{"nofollow":false,"sponsored":false,"openInNewTab":false},"type":"interstitial_link","content":"¡22 segundos de horror! Sicario tumbó de su moto a criador de perros y lo acribilló: todo quedó grabado","url":"https://trome.com/actualidad/policiales/chorrillos-sicario-tumbo-de-su-moto-a-criador-de-perros-y-lo-mato-a-balazos-foto-video-historia-de-policiales-noticia/"}]},{"_id":"3GTJE4HWTRHPRD22NWZCSYWVXM","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><i><b>“Se ha identificado un error material en el encabezado, donde se consignó ‘Senado’ en lugar de ‘Congreso’. He dispuesto que se tramite la fe de erratas correspondiente de inmediato</b></i></mark><i>”</i>, informó el titular de la cámara de senadores, mediante un comunicado."},{"_id":"LGMDDF67BJEW5PI5SV25A47PFM","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Agregó que ‘corregir lo que corresponde también es un deber y una muestra de respeto a quienes representamos, a la transparencia y la institucionalidad.’"},{"_id":"QA3SWPW2BRBMBGKGKR723WUEEA","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Pese al comunicado, <mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>el directivo de Fuerza Popular</b></mark> un día antes había afirmado que no había ningún error en la promulgación de la Ley de la delegación de facultades."},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"b27bc9e8555a11b6645db8cce642722ba048c7b499d56437d26751eb369600ab"},"caption":"Comunicado del presidente de la Cámara del Senado Miki Torres.","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/MDFKNAIZF5F2TAVHKWE4IGYSY4.jpg","licensable":false,"alt_text":"Miki Torres","credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"Miki Torres","width":1080,"_id":"MDFKNAIZF5F2TAVHKWE4IGYSY4","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/MDFKNAIZF5F2TAVHKWE4IGYSY4.jpg?auth=b27bc9e8555a11b6645db8cce642722ba048c7b499d56437d26751eb369600ab","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/MDFKNAIZF5F2TAVHKWE4IGYSY4.jpg?auth=b27bc9e8555a11b6645db8cce642722ba048c7b499d56437d26751eb369600ab","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/MDFKNAIZF5F2TAVHKWE4IGYSY4.jpg","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/MDFKNAIZF5F2TAVHKWE4IGYSY4.jpg?auth=b27bc9e8555a11b6645db8cce642722ba048c7b499d56437d26751eb369600ab","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/MDFKNAIZF5F2TAVHKWE4IGYSY4.jpg?auth=b27bc9e8555a11b6645db8cce642722ba048c7b499d56437d26751eb369600ab&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"miki torres.jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-25T02:12:26Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-25T02:12:26Z","height":1483,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"level":2,"_id":"GVOUZ6FJK5HUTLQQL45HLIBI7M","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>Polémica por publicación de ley de delegación de facultades</b></mark>"},{"_id":"65AZVBAGGBBLFI3OFAHEO5EGAM","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Recordemos qu<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>e tras la publicación de la norma</b></mark>, el presidente de la Cámara de Diputados, Óscar Reto Otero, había considerado que la publicación también debe incluir la firma de la vicepresidenta de esta cámara, Analí Arias, y la suya."},{"_id":"DFC4O2PDYJHBJB5HXZHJ5TM6RU","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Debido a no incluir la firma del presidente de Reto, el abogado Javier Adrianzén Cerreño presentó una de denuncia penal ante el Ministerio Público por presunto abuso de autoridad contra la presidenta Keiko Fujimori, el presidente del Consejo de Ministros, Luis Galarreta; Alejandro Muñante y contra el propio <mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><b>Miguel Torres.</b></mark>"},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"c7a9b762d03b73afe97fdf931f523e585dc2a087445711c83c25e132876dbebe"},"caption":"Cámara del Senado. ","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/FT6I75MUD5BYNBUKBEPQHIDQXU.jpg","licensable":false,"credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"Elección de la Cámara del Senado.","width":2048,"_id":"FT6I75MUD5BYNBUKBEPQHIDQXU","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/FT6I75MUD5BYNBUKBEPQHIDQXU.jpg?auth=c7a9b762d03b73afe97fdf931f523e585dc2a087445711c83c25e132876dbebe","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/FT6I75MUD5BYNBUKBEPQHIDQXU.jpg?auth=c7a9b762d03b73afe97fdf931f523e585dc2a087445711c83c25e132876dbebe","link":"","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/FT6I75MUD5BYNBUKBEPQHIDQXU.jpg","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/FT6I75MUD5BYNBUKBEPQHIDQXU.jpg?auth=c7a9b762d03b73afe97fdf931f523e585dc2a087445711c83c25e132876dbebe","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/FT6I75MUD5BYNBUKBEPQHIDQXU.jpg?auth=c7a9b762d03b73afe97fdf931f523e585dc2a087445711c83c25e132876dbebe&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"55420981663_149fe80d49_k.jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","alt_text":"","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-07-26T18:47:15Z","last_updated_date":"2026-07-26T18:47:15Z","height":1365,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"_id":"GPXQK6S4GNEPZP6NV72JUD4PBU","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"MÁS INFORMACIÓN:"},{"_id":"Z3YUEWLHQNH5PF6IRNAKQO7SIY","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://trome.com/actualidad/nacional/juliaca-pnp-allana-local-y-detienen-a-pareja-acusada-de-integrar-mafia-de-trata-de-personas-noticia/\" rel=\"\">Juliaca: PNP allana local y detiene a pareja acusada de integrar mafia de trata de personas</a>"},{"_id":"XCZHRCVY5VDJDMU7PEOA5S7H6E","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://trome.com/actualidad/policiales/crimen-y-castigo-mato-a-su-cunada-la-descuartizo-le-saco-los-organos-y-dejo-sus-restos-en-bolsas-en-cusco-foto-video-historia-de-policiales-noticia/\" rel=\"\">Cusco: Mató a su cuñada, la descuartizó, le sacó los órganos y dejó sus restos en bolsas por un terreno</a>"},{"_id":"CHIGVL6SX5CIZBIQRV7OQSQ2II","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://trome.com/actualidad/nacional/callao-hombre-sobrevive-tras-casi-4-horas-sepultado-bajo-tierra-noticia/\" rel=\"\">¡De milagro! Trabajador sobrevive tras casi 4 horas sepultado bajo tierra en el Callao</a>"},{"subtype":"about_author","_id":"EXVAXZAMABA73I5H3MXRUJARKQ","embed":{"id":"1792893275235","config":{"authorTwitter":"tromepe","authorSlug":"redaccion-trome","authorName":"Redacción Trome","authorImage":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/arc-authors/elcomercio/261f2003-e2e3-42b0-afa5-d943c81ceade.jpg","authorLinkedIn":"","authorBio":"Los periodistas de la Redacción T